The code of the Sun Paladins can be a heavy burden. Wouldn't you like to let go?

{{color|grey|''To give in to the darkness?''}}

{{color|crimson|This evolution fundamentally alters your class and character in a huge way. Do not take it lightly.}}

Any offensive combat techniques or unlockable Celestial talent trees you know will be exchanged for cursed versions, allowing you to cut a bloody trail through enemies, turning your radiance to gloom, and more while also gaining new combat styles and defenses.

The following talent trees are swapped:

*{{color|gold|Radiance}} turns into {{c|Gloom|{{color|crimson|Gloom}}}}: Project onto others your own hate, hindering them
*{{color|gold|Guardian}} turns into {{c|Crimson Templar|{{color|crimson|Crimson Templar}}}}: Use the power of blood to control and defeat the fools that oppose you
*{{color|gold|Crusader}} turns into {{c|Dark Sun|{{color|crimson|Dark Sun}}}}: Call upon the energies of dead suns to crush your foes

You will learn the following talents trees:

*{{c|Bloodstained|{{color|crimson|Bloodstained}}}}: Make your foes bleed!
*{{c|Darkside|{{color|crimson|Darkside}}}}: Every light casts a shadow, yours is powerful indeed
*{{c|Hatred|{{color|crimson|Hatred}}}}: Manifest your hatred through bleeding
*{{c|Dirges|{{color|crimson|Dirge}}}}: Sing of death and sorrow to strengthen your resolve

You will forget the following talent trees, refunding any talent points: Shield Offense, Two-handed Assault.

Also the cost of any talents of the {{c|Combat Techniques}} tree will be converted to hate instead of stamina.<br>
''Note: This also affects some {{c|Combat Veteran}} talents ({{t|Quick Recovery}} and {{t|Unending Frenzy}}), which will now restore hate in addition to stamina. ''
